{"title":"2020 IMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/d/5cd3ce2c3ab0e47a5cbe198801804eb7fa4b3937.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\geq b \\geq c \\geq d &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"140\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/031176eccf8829ed19ec5eb17f10ca76ca77fdaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + c + d = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"133\" height=\"14\" />. Prove that<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/b/f8b5f041651570b7cb1171443f4e990bd8cd991f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a + 2b + 3c + 4d) a^a b^b c^c d^d &lt; 1.\\]\" width=\"242\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using Weighted AM-GM we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/8/ea8302818d5595365962a74f4a39cda18b4ee621.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a\\cdot a +b\\cdot b +c\\cdot c +d\\cdot d}{a+b+c+d} \\ge \\sqrt[a+b+c+d]{a^a b^b c^c d^d}\\]\" width=\"338\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/c/b4cf3aebe71d2bcfd733e0067e8844b7d4406415.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies a^a b^b c^c d^d \\le a^2 +b^2 +c^2 +d^2\\]\" width=\"256\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/0/20089419d092c2e8e18d6021aaaaddccd188f25f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a+2b+3c+4d) a^ab^bc^cd^d \\le (a+2b+3c+4d)(a^2+b^2+c^2+d^2)\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Now notice that\n</p>\n<pre>   <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/c/3fcf0c125107505610d157af3d2e65f48344c403.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a+2b+3c+4d \\text{ will be less then the following expressions (and the reason is written to the right)}\\]\" width=\"699\" height=\"17\" />\n   <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/6/7f68fcd2ecb874690f783efaf7b0000ed81024f1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a+3b+3c+3d,\\text{as } d\\le b\\]\" width=\"198\" height=\"16\" />\n   <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/3/dc3b0da262b1c480db556924fbb655e0b511f146.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3a+3b+3c+d,              \\text{as }  d\\le a\\]\" width=\"200\" height=\"16\" />\n   <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/b/f0b6aa02b7aba6edd5480d1852ff5d8a8ce51ac3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3a+b+3c+3d, \\text{as }  b+d\\le 2a\\]\" width=\"239\" height=\"16\" />\n <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/3/0c3a09434feb4074e21f4cb81f633d58b7fa24e1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3a+3b+c+3d, \\text{as } 2c+d \\le 2a+b\\]\" width=\"278\" height=\"16\" />\n</pre>\n<p><br />\nSo, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/a/65a78c74dd8d31067858ea863104d6e28603a7b1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{split}&amp;~~~~(a+2b+3c+4d)(a^2+b^2+c^2+d^2) \\\\ &amp;= a^2(a+2b+3c+4d)+b^2(a+2b+3c+4d)+c^2 (a+2b+3c+4d) +d^2 (a+2b+3c+4d)\\\\  &amp;\\le a^2(a+3b+3c+3d)+b^2(3a+b+3c+3d)+c^2 (3a+3b+c+3d) +d^2 (3a+3b+3c+d)\\\\ &amp;&lt;(a+b+c+d)^3 \\\\&amp;=1\\end{split}\\]\" width=\"719\" height=\"123\" />\n</p><p>Now, for equality we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/6/3a671ef0b71ccc113d5921db5c0bdff534b208f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=c=d=\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"143\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>In that case we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5bb043b7080e9aa0706ced4c33f09ba55c789f4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a+2b+3c+4d) a^ab^bc^cd^d \\le (a+2b+3c+4d)(a^2+b^2+c^2+d^2) =\\frac{5}{8} &lt;1\\]\" width=\"537\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><br />\n~Shen Kislay kai\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_solution\">Video solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/bDHtM1wijbY\">https://youtu.be/bDHtM1wijbY</a> [Video covers all day 1 problems]\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_IMO\" title=\"2020 IMO\">2020 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2020 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2020 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2020 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018013045\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 128/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 894/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3735/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.679      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%    6.679      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:19749:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018013045 and revision id 226304. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}